OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud across
OL,6,Fnorthern England and Northern Ireland
OL,7,Fwill continue to sink south overnight.
OL,8,FDry with clear spells elsewhere.
OL,9,FOutbreaks of rain will push into the
OL,10,Fnorthwest and north Wales during the
OL,11,Fearly hours. Can be heavy at times.
OL,12,FStaying mild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CWednesday:FShowers or longer spells of
OL,15,Frain will move eastwards across many
OL,16,Fcentral areas during the day. It will
OL,17,Fremain dry but cloudy in the far north
OL,18,Fand far southeast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
